    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-5 text-5xl leading-tight md:text-7xl">
     Rolfing Ten Series in Folsom
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-7 text-xl leading-9 text-[#545454]/85">
     The Rolfing Ten Series is the classic structured sequence of Rolfing Structural Integration. Instead of treating each appointment as separate, the series works progressively through the whole body to support deeper organization and integration.
    </p>
   </div>
   <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl space-y-12 text-lg leading-9 text-[#545454]/85">
    <section>
     <h2 class="text-4xl leading-tight text-[#545454]">
      Why a series?
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5">
      Bodies change through relationships. The way the feet meet the ground affects the knees, hips, spine, ribs, neck, and breath. The Ten Series gives enough time to work through those relationships instead of only addressing the most obvious symptom.
     </p>
     <p class="mt-5">
      Each session has a theme, but the work is adapted to the person in front of us.
     </p>
    </section>
    <section>
     <h2 class="text-4xl leading-tight text-[#545454]">
      A whole-body progression
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5">
      The early sessions often focus on breath, superficial fascia, support through the legs and feet, and the body’s relationship with gravity. Later sessions can address deeper structures, spinal organization, movement patterns, and integration.
     </p>
     <p class="mt-5">
      The exact experience is personal, but the overall arc is toward more support, adaptability, and coherence.
     </p>
    </section>
    <section>
     <h2 class="text-4xl leading-tight text-[#545454]">
      Who it is for
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5">
      The Ten Series can be useful for people who want more than occasional symptom relief. It may fit if you are ready to invest in body awareness, posture, movement, old patterns, and long-term structural change.
     </p>
     <p class="mt-5">
      It is also a good fit for people who are curious, committed, and willing to notice how changes unfold between sessions.
     </p>
    </section>
    <section>
     <h2 class="text-4xl leading-tight text-[#545454]">
      Integration matters
     </h2>
     <p class="mt-5">
      The final sessions help connect the changes so they become usable in ordinary life. Rolfing is not just about what happens on the table. It is about how you stand, walk, breathe, work, relate, and inhabit your body afterward.
     </p>
     <p class="mt-5">
      That is why the series can feel educational as well as therapeutic.
     </p>
    </section>
   </div>
   <section class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-4xl rounded-[2rem] bg-[#545454] p-8 text-white md:p-10">
    <h2 class="text-4xl">
     Good signs this work may fit
    </h2>
    <ul class="mt-7 list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 text-white/82">
