      You want a structured whole-body process.
     </li>
     <li>
      You are interested in posture, movement, breath, and long-term change.
     </li>
     <li>
      You have recurring patterns that do not resolve with isolated sessions.
     </li>
     <li>
      You want to understand your body, not just get worked on.
     </li>
    </ul>
