      </summary>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-[#545454]/85">
       No. Some people begin with an individual session. The Ten Series is best when you know you want a more structured and committed process.
      </p>
     </details>
     <details class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f8f6f2] p-6">
